Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFF&}HE IS AWAKE.{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The spinning top was Nolan's misdirection.
